\description{
Given a fitted one-way \code{\link[stats]{aov}} or \code{\link[stats]{lm}}
object and a set of contrast weights, computes for every contrast the
estimate \eqn{\hat{\psi} = \sum_i c_i \bar{Y}_i}, its standard error,
